  "answer_text": "Here is a list of the **best free online auto repair estimate tools** available:\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udd27 Top Free Online Auto Repair Estimate Sites\n\n### 1. \ud83c\udfc6 [RepairPal](https://repairpal.com/estimator)\nRepairPal has been the #1 automotive industry estimator since 2008, developed by ASE-certified mechanics, and is trusted by millions of consumers and over 3,800 RepairPal Certified locations. The estimator brings together automotive industry standard data for parts pricing and labor times to deliver fair price ranges for common repairs and services. If the repair cost exceeds the estimate range, they can intervene to work with the shop on your behalf or refund the difference \u2014 shops agree to honor the RepairPal Price Guarantee for 30 days after the repair is performed.\n\n---\n\n### 2. \ud83d\ude97 [Kelley Blue Book (KBB)](https://www.kbb.com/auto-repair/)\nKBB offers a free car repair estimator to find out what you should expect to pay for common auto repairs and maintenance. Estimating repair costs using their tool is the best and easiest way to know how much you can expect to pay, based on what others have paid.\n\n---\n\n### 3. \ud83d\udd29 [YourMechanic](https://www.yourmechanic.com/estimates/)\nYourMechanic offers free instant auto repair and maintenance estimates with a full price breakdown including parts and labor. They have provided over 600,000 car repair estimates since 2012. Their mechanics are fully mobile with no brick-and-mortar shop to maintain, meaning very low overhead costs \u2014 and they pass those savings on to you. You can choose from 600+ repair, maintenance, and diagnostic services backed by a 12-month, 12,000-mile warranty.\n\n---\n\n### 4. \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f [NAPA Auto Care Repair Estimator](https://www.napaonline.com/en/auto-care/car-repair-estimator)\nThe NAPA Auto Care Repair Estimator is a quick and easy way to get price estimates for the most common car repairs and routine maintenance services, specific to your exact make and model.\n\n---\n\n### 5. \ud83c\udfa8 [Maaco Online Estimator](https://www.maaco.com/online-estimator/) *(Body & Paint)*\nMaaco offers a free online estimate specifically for auto body repair, painting, and collision repair services \u2014 click to get a preliminary estimate today.\n\n---\n\n### 6. \ud83d\udca5 [Instant Estimator](https://www.instantestimator.com/) *(Auto Body)*\nInstant Estimator claims to be the first and best auto body damage estimating tool, and also connects you to authorized auto body repair facilities in your area. It is completely free to use.\n\n---\n\n### 7. \ud83c\udfce\ufe0f [Caliber Collision Online Estimate](https://www.caliber.com/online-estimate) *(Collision & Glass)*\nCaliber provides a free initial online estimate for auto body and collision repair and auto glass services, offering contactless repair estimates online.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udca1 Tips for Getting the Best Estimate:\n- Find out what other repair shops will charge for the same work and weigh the costs carefully.\n- Once you know the estimated range of a typical repair, you equip yourself with knowledge of the costs \u2014 while fixed costs like the car part may not be negotiable, dealerships and repair shops will sometimes offer a break.\n- For common repairs or maintenance items like oil changes, new brakes, or tune-ups, you can often find a promotion or coupon \u2014 and if you're a regular customer, ask for a loyalty discount.\n- The best way to keep your car repair costs low is to keep up with regular maintenance on your vehicle.",
